# Case of the Pilfered Proof: "Whenever a Detective you control enters or is turned face up, put a +1/+1 counter on it." (CR 603.6a, 122.1). With the Case out, Bot1's Memnite
# (not a Detective) enters as a 1/1, and its Novice Inspector (a Human Detective, 1/2) enters with the trigger putting a +1/+1 counter on it, a 2/3. On turn 2 Bot2's own
# Novice Inspector enters and stays 1/2: a Detective, but not one Bot1 controls. The Case is unsolved throughout, so the Inspector's investigate makes exactly one Clue.

